      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "This operation outputs a copy of the input tensor, where values from the `batchAxis` dimension are moved in spatial blocks of size `blockDimensions` to the `spatialAxes` dimensions (for `usePixelShuffleOrder=YES` 1,2 or 3 axes supported, otherwise limited only by `MPSNDArray` rank limitations).",
      "normalizedSource": "This operation outputs a copy of the input tensor, where values from the `batchAxis` dimension are moved in spatial blocks of size `blockDimensions` to the `spatialAxes` dimensions (for `usePixelShuffleOrder=YES` 1,2 or 3 axes supported, otherwise limited only by `MPSNDArray` rank limitations).",
